---
<Tunnel title="Fresh Drive | Save My Gig!" status="Quick_Fix">
  <div class="review-flag">DRAFT — review pending.</div>
  <div class="step-label">Plan B</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">Build tonight on a different drive</h2>

  <p>Stop fighting the sick drive — you have time to build a healthy one.</p>

  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>Get <strong>any other USB drive</strong> — borrow, buy at a petrol station, anything.</li>
    <li>Format it: <span class="mono">FAT32</span> + <span class="mono">MBR</span>.</li>
    <li>Export tonight's playlists from Rekordbox — or copy the music files you backed up.</li>
    <li>Verify: eject, replug, everything loads.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="question">Is the fresh drive working?</p>

  <Choice step="qf_fresh_usb"
    a={{ href: '/saved?path=quick_fix&branch=fresh_usb', label: "YES — I'M READY", event: 'outcome_reached', data: { outcome: 'saved', path: 'quick_fix' } }}
    b={{ href: '/protocol/critical', label: 'NO — OUT OF OPTIONS OR TIME', desc: 'Switch to the critical path: workarounds and survival mode.' }}
  />
</Tunnel>
